  "decision_conditions": [
    "Reason : 1 - The proposed amalgamation of flats 'Flat Basement D' and 'Flat Ground floor A' at Anhalt Road London SW11 4NZ into a single dwelling would amount to a material change of use for the purposes of Section 55 of the Town and Country Planning Act 1990 (as amended) for which a grant of planning permission would be required.",
    "Reason : 2 - INFORMATIVE: Planning permission would be required in respect of the proposed works.  Should the applicants opt to submit a full application for the proposal then, amongst other relevant policies, due regard should be paid to the requirements of policies LP25 (Protecting the Existing Housing Stock) and LP27 (Housing Standards) when considering the design and layout of the proposed flat. Policy LP27 advises that existing self-contained housing will be protected in accordance with Policy H8 of the London Plan and that in exceptional circumstances, the net loss of self-contained residential dwellings will be acceptable where the proposal involves combining no more than two non-family-sized dwellings in order to create a family-sized dwelling (3 bedroom, min. 84sqm GIA) and the total floorspace of the new dwelling created will be less than or equal to 130sqm. "
